; The NTVDM.EXE exports a Microsoft-ABI VDD links against, as NTVDMEX's NTVDM.EXE
; (bin\wowshim\, src/shim/wowshim.c) provides them -- the import library the NT DDK's
; ntvdm.lib is. Every export is STDCALL (@ = argument bytes); the module's names are
; undecorated, so build with `dlltool -k`. See docs/sdk/vdd-sdk.md. SDK version 2.
LIBRARY NTVDM.EXE
EXPORTS
getAX@0
setAX@4
getBX@0
setBX@4
